## Model card

- **Name:** Codestral 25.08
- **Short description:** Mistral's hosted coding model (Codestral line, August 2025 cut) — fill-in-the-middle code generation/completion and chat; coding-only SKU, not a general chat model.
- **Provider / access:** Mistral La Plateforme (hosted; 12 listed providers per models.dev); Azure AI / Foundry distribution; OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2025-07-30 (25.08 cut); knowledge cutoff not publicly stated.
- **IDs:** `codestral-25.08` / `mistral/codestral-2508` (La Plateforme)
- **Context window:** 128,000 tokens; max output 8,192 tokens (models.dev).
- **Modalities:** text in → text out; reasoning NO; tool calls yes.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $0.30 / 1M input, $0.90 / 1M output (models.dev).
- **Architecture:** proprietary hosted (closed); parameter count undisclosed.

